# fm84 în limba română.
#
# Each msgid is the English as the code has it, and the msgstr under it what
# is shown in its place. A sentence with a count in it has a msgstr for each
# form the count takes: [one] for 1, [few] for 0 and for 2 to 19 by the last
# two digits, [other] for the rest, which takes "de" - "20 de fișiere". A
# msgctxt sets one use of a word apart from the same word elsewhere. {name}
# is a place the program fills, kept as it is. The keys to press - Y, N, A
# and the like - stay as they are.

